---

<Layout title={`Inicio`} description={`Bienvenido a nuestra clínica pediátrica en ${siteConfig.location.city}, donde la salud y el bienestar de tus hijos son nuestra prioridad. Descubre un entorno seguro, moderno y acogedor diseñado para brindar atención médica integral a los más pequeños de la casa. Con especialistas certificados, tecnología avanzada y un enfoque humano, ofrecemos servicios que acompañan cada etapa del crecimiento infantil. Tu tranquilidad comienza aquí, en un lugar donde cada sonrisa cuenta.`}>
  <!-- <Welcome />  Removido client:load para evitar problemas de hidratación -->
<section id="hero-parallax" class="relative min-h-screen w-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 -mt-16 sm:-mt-20">
  
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0" id="carousel-bg">
    <div class="carousel-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-1000">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center animate-ken-burns" style="background-image: url('/images/hero-pediatric.jpg');"></div> 
    </div>
    <div class="carousel-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('/images/benefit-modern.jpg');"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="carousel-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('/images/contact-emergency.jpg');"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none select-none" id="parallax-icons">
    <div class="absolute top-[15%] left-[10%] parallax-layer" data-speed="2">
      <i data-lucide="baby" class="w-16 h-16 text-yellow-200/40 animate-float"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute top-[20%] right-[15%] parallax-layer" data-speed="-3">
      <i class="bi bi-heart-fill text-4xl text-pink-300/30 animate-float-delayed"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[20%] left-[15%] parallax-layer" data-speed="4">
      <i data-lucide="stethoscope" class="w-12 h-12 text-white/20 animate-float-slow -rotate-12"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[25%] right-[10%] parallax-layer" data-speed="-2">
      <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-3xl text-yellow-100/30 animate-float"></i>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-20 text-center text-white px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 mb-8 text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 rounded-full animate-fade-in">
      <i class="bi bi-shield-check text-yellow-200"></i> Especialistas en pediatría
    </span>

    <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-[0.85] mb-8 animate-slide-up">
      Atención pediátrica en <br />
      <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-yellow-200 via-white to-yellow-200 bg-clip-text text-transparent italic font-serif py-2">
        {siteConfig.location.city}
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-light mb-12 text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed animate-slide-up animation-delay-200">
      Cuidamos lo que más amas con tecnología moderna y un trato <strong>dulce y humano.</strong>
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 justify-center items-center animate-slide-up animation-delay-400">
      <a href="/reserva" class="group relative bg-white text-pink-500 px-12 py-5 rounded-2xl font-bold text-lg overflow-hidden transition-all hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(255,182,193,0.4)]">
        <span class="relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3">
          <i class="bi bi-whatsapp text-xl"></i> Reservar Cita
        </span>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-pink-100/50 to-transparent -translate-x-full group-hover:animate-shimmer"></div>
      </a>

      <a href="/nosotros" class="px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-bold text-lg text-white border-2 border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/10 transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
        <i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i> Conócenos
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

  <main class="main-section overflow-hidden bg-white">
  <span class="cloud cloud--1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--4" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--5" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--6" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--7" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--8" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--9" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--10" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--11" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="cloud cloud--12" aria-hidden="true"></span>

 <!-- Sobre la Clínica -->
<section class="py-24 relative z-10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">


      <!-- Texto -->
      <div class="space-y-6 reveal-right">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs animate-bounce-soft">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
          Sobre la Clínica
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 leading-tight">
          Cuidamos la salud de tus hijos
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-blue-400">
            con amor y profesionalismo
          </span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          En <strong class="text-gray-900">{siteConfig.name}</strong>, 
          brindamos atención médica pediátrica especializada en un entorno 
          seguro, moderno y diseñado especialmente para el bienestar de los niños.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Nuestro equipo de profesionales trabaja con vocación, experiencia 
          y tecnología avanzada para acompañar a cada niño en todas las 
          etapas de su crecimiento y desarrollo.
        </p>

        <!-- Características -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-6">

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-blue-500">
              <i data-lucide="stethoscope" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Pediatras especializados</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-pink-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-pink-500">
              <i data-lucide="heart" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Atención con calidez</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-green-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-green-500">
              <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Seguridad infantil</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-purple-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-purple-500">
              <i data-lucide="baby" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Ambiente amigable</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Imagen -->
      <div class="relative reveal-left">
        <div class="absolute -top-10 -left-10 w-72 h-72 bg-blue-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60"></div>

        <img 
          src="/images/clinic-4.jpg"
          alt="Clínica pediátrica moderna"
          class="rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-white relative z-10"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

    <!-- Sección de servicios: Grid con imágenes y overlays -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 md:py-32 px-4">
      <!-- Este contenedor va encima de las nubes -->
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-12 md:mb-20 gap-8">
          <div class="max-w-2xl">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-50 text-green-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs animate-bounce-soft">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
             Nuestros Servicios
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 leading-tight">
              Cuidado Integral <br />
              <span class="bg-clip-text text-green-400 italic">Pediátrico</span>
            </h2>
          </div>

          <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
            Especialidades médicas diseñadas para acompañar cada etapa del crecimiento de tus hijos, desde sus primeros 
            meses de vida hasta la adolescencia, brindando atención integral, preventiva y personalizada que protege su 
            salud, fortalece su desarrollo físico y emocional, y ofrece tranquilidad y confianza a toda la familia.
         </p>

        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 lg:gap-12">
          {
            quickServices.map((service, index) => (
              <div class={`group relative min-h-115 md:h-100 overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 hover:-translate-y-4 ${
                  index % 2 !== 0 ? "lg:mt-8" : ""
                } ${service.cardColor} ${service.cardHover}`}
                role="article">
                <img src={service.image}
                  alt={service.title}
                  class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110"
                  />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-gray-900 via-gray-900/40 to-transparent opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity duration-500" />

                <div class="absolute inset-0 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-end transform transition-transform duration-500">
                  <div class={`w-12 h-12 md:w-16 md:h-16 ${service.color} backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-4 md:mb-6 border border-white/30 ${service.hoverColor} transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl`}>
                    <i data-lucide={service.icon}
                      class="w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 group-hover:animate-pulse"
                      aria-hidden="true"
                    />
                  </div>

                  <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight">
                    {service.title}
                  </h3>

                  <p class="text-gray-200 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4 md:mb-6 opacity-100 md:opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 translate-y-0 md:translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0">
                    {service.desc}
                  </p>

                  <div class="overflow-hidden h-12 md:h-0 group-hover:h-12 transition-all duration-500">
                    <a
                      href={`/servicios#${service.title.toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g, "-")}`}
                      class={`inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-white font-bold text-sm ${service.buttonColor} ${service.buttonHover} px-4 md:px-6 py-2 md:py-3 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors`}>
                      Saber más
                      <i data-lucide="chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4" />
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    
  

          <!-- Sección de Equipo Médico -->
            <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 md:py-32 px-4">

          <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">

            <!-- Encabezado -->
            <div class="text-center mb-20">

              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink-50 text-pink-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs animate-bounce-soft">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pink-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                Equipo Médico
              </span>

              <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-4 leading-tight">
                Especialistas
                <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-pink-400 to-pink-500 italic">
                  comprometidos
                </span>
                con tu familia
              </h2>

              <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed">
                Nuestro equipo está conformado por profesionales altamente capacitados
                en pediatría, dedicados a brindar atención médica segura, humana
                y especializada para cada etapa del crecimiento infantil.
              </p>

            </div>

            <!-- Doctores -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10">

              {doctors.map((doctor, index) => (
                <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-3 border border-gray-100">

                  <div class="relative aspect-4/5 overflow-hidden">

                    <img
                      src={doctor.image}
                      alt={doctor.name}
                      class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
                      loading="lazy"
                    />

                    <!-- Overlay -->
                    <div class={`absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t ${
                      doctor.color === 'green' ? 'from-green-900/80' :
                      doctor.color === 'blue' ? 'from-blue-900/80' :
                      doctor.color === 'yellow' ? 'from-yellow-900/80' :
                      'from-purple-900/80'
                    } via-transparent to-transparent opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-90 transition`}></div>

                    <!-- Tags -->
                    <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                      {doctor.tags.map((tag) => (
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-full border border-white/30">
                          {tag}
                        </span>
                      ))}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <!-- Info -->
                  <div class="p-6 text-center">

                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">
                      {doctor.name}
                    </h3>

                    <p class={`text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-3 ${
                      doctor.color === 'green' ? 'text-green-500' :
                      doctor.color === 'blue' ? 'text-blue-500' :
                      doctor.color === 'yellow' ? 'text-yellow-500' :
                      'text-purple-500'
                    }`}>
                      {doctor.role}
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm italic border-t pt-4 border-gray-100">
                      "{doctor.specialty}"
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>

            <!-- Botón -->
           </div>
            <div class="text-center mt-16">
              <a
                href="/equipo"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-pink-500 font-semibold text-lg group"
              >
                Ver equipo completo
                <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-pink-100 group-hover:bg-pink-500 group-hover:text-white transition">
                  <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                </span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

          <section class="dr-quote2">
      <div class="quote-content animate-on-scroll animate-scale-in">
        <h2 class="quote">
          "Brindamos atención pediátrica especializada, enfocada en prevenir, cuidar y fortalecer la salud integral de cada niño."
        </h2>
        <p class="name">— Pediatrica</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    
    <!-- Sección de Infraestructura mejorada -->
    <section class="relative py-16 md:py-24 px-4 overflow-hidden bg-linear-to-b from-blue-50 via-white to-white">
      <!-- Decorative clouds background -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
        <span class="cloud cloud--1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="cloud cloud--2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="cloud cloud--3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-purple-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs animate-bounce-soft">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
             Instalaciones
            </span>

